# Environment variables for tijothomas.dev
#
# All variables are optional. With none set, the site builds and runs; terminal analytics is a no-op
# (TERM-AC-06). Never commit real values. The chat assistant is off, so no LLM key is used (ADR-P2).

# ===========================================
# Analytics (Supabase, optional)
# ===========================================

# Get these from: https://supabase.com/dashboard
# The anon key is public by design; never put the service-role key in this app (SQ-07).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here
